            "body": "Yeah, fallback to default tabline in case of multiple tabs is an initial design. Mainly because of two reasons: simplify module's logic and lack of certainty what should be displayed with several tabs. And also I don't really use tabs, so didn't have motivation to work on it.\r\n\r\nWhat would you expect to be shown in tabline when there are multiple tabs?",
