        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After a third look at it, I decided to introduce breaking change and show buffer list also when multiple tabpages are open. I quite rarely use them, but it indeed feels inconsistent to fall back to default tabline (hence a breaking change and not an option).\r\n\r\nTo show that there are multiple tabs open, there is a \"tabpage section\": displays number of current tab and total number of tabs. Its position can be configured via `tabpage_section` option.\r\n\r\nAll in all, thanks @shubham-cpp for useful suggestion.",
